{
  "id": "escBorrarArchivosVideo01",
  "name": "Borrar archivos de video",
  "description": "Subworkflow. Recibe { rutas_base: [..] } (carpetas de videos del bucket privado videos), lista todo lo que cuelga de cada una (el original y la carpeta hls) y lo borra de Supabase Storage con la credencial de rol de servicio. Lo usan Video procesado, Borrar video y las limpiezas de clases y secciones.",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "none",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
    "saveManualExecutions": false,
    "saveExecutionProgress": false,
    "executionTimeout": 15
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Entrada\nRecibe `rutas_base`: las carpetas `cursos/<c>/secciones/<s>/clases/<k>/<video>` que hay que vaciar.",
        "height": 430,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d2abafca-1197-542b-b59a-1218e0bbbcc4",
      "name": "Nota Entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -70,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Listar\nPor cada carpeta lista el original y la subcarpeta `hls` (Storage no borra por prefijo).",
        "height": 430,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b929e2fc-314b-5faa-9017-faba981fd564",
      "name": "Nota Listar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Borrar\nBorra todos los archivos de golpe. Si no hay ninguno, termina sin hacer nada.",
        "height": 530,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "ebe083cf-2978-521b-a8c8-0a75d253df44",
      "name": "Nota Borrar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Borrar archivos de video\nSubworkflow compartido: **nadie repite la limpieza de Storage**.\n\nEntrada: `{ rutas_base: [...] }`. Con la credencial **Supabase rol de servicio**. El borrado es de mejor esfuerzo: la fila de la base ya no existe cuando se llama.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e8d25d10-7001-5748-b9dc-0e009da7d620",
      "name": "Nota Borrar archivos de video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -550
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "368de38f-1aec-570d-95c4-27a3dbbd96ad",
      "name": "Disparador",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const bases = $input.first().json.rutas_base || [];\nreturn bases.flatMap((b) => [{ json: { prefijo: b } }, { json: { prefijo: `${b}/hls` } }]);"
      },
      "id": "29a2931f-c377-506e-8c86-7189f5357ca3",
      "name": "Preparar carpetas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=http://storage:5000/object/list/videos",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prefix: $json.prefijo, limit: 1000 }) }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "a0329391-3def-57a4-9b44-1ee452d03132",
      "name": "Listar archivos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "supabaseServicio01",
          "name": "Supabase rol de servicio"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const carpetas = $('Preparar carpetas').all();\nconst rutas = [];\n$input.all().forEach((r, i) => {\n  const lista = Array.isArray(r.json.body) ? r.json.body : [];\n  lista.filter((e) => e.id).forEach((e) => rutas.push(`${carpetas[i].json.prefijo}/${e.name}`));\n});\nreturn [{ json: { rutas } }];"
      },
      "id": "7603c6e1-7964-5ec8-93cc-82cf16316066",
      "name": "Juntar archivos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "61a63f1a-9f98-5936-baa6-f40a7acec7ac",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.rutas.length > 0 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "51798efa-1558-5f6f-9857-430422d81b79",
      "name": "Hay archivos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "=http://storage:5000/object/videos",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prefixes: $json.rutas }) }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "e6fe8318-7749-5dbf-865c-68b63267de01",
      "name": "Borrar archivos en Storage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "supabaseServicio01",
          "name": "Supabase rol de servicio"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
